This package is a TypeScript port of parts of MTEB (Massive Text Embedding
Benchmark), version 2.26.28, https://github.com/embeddings-benchmark/mteb,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The ported files
were changed: docs/ported-from-mteb.md lists each source module and each
difference.

It also ports the semantics of parts of these dependencies of MTEB:

- pytrec_eval (terrierteam/pytrec_eval 0.5.11), Copyright (c) 2017 Christophe
  Van Gysel, MIT License, and the trec_eval measures that it binds
  (https://github.com/usnistgov/trec_eval).
- NumPy 2.5.4 (sum, mean, standard deviation, add.reduceat, stable argsort,
  linspace, corrcoef, the sum of float32 values, and the MT19937 generator,
  randint, random_sample, choice and permutation of the legacy RandomState),
  Copyright (c) NumPy Developers, BSD 3-Clause License. The pairwise summation of float64 values
  is the npm dependency @stdlib/blas-ext-base-gsumpw, Copyright (c) The Stdlib
  Authors, Apache License 2.0. The package does not include its code.
- scikit-learn 1.9.1 (sklearn.metrics.auc and average_precision_score,
  paired_cosine_distances, paired_euclidean_distances,
  paired_manhattan_distances, normalize, row_norms, v_measure_score,
  adjusted_mutual_info_score and MiniBatchKMeans), Copyright (c) scikit-learn
  developers, BSD 3-Clause License.
- SciPy 1.18.1 (scipy.stats.rankdata, pearsonr and spearmanr, and
  scipy.special.gammaln, the lgam of Cephes by Stephen L. Moshier), Copyright
  (c) 2001-2002 Enthought, Inc. 2003, SciPy Developers, BSD 3-Clause License.
- packaging 26.3 (packaging.version), Copyright (c) Donald Stufft and
  individual contributors, Apache License 2.0 or BSD 2-Clause License.
- CPython 3.12 (the float sum, round, repr and heapq algorithms), Copyright (c)
  Python Software Foundation, PSF License Agreement.
- bm25s 0.3.16 (tokenize and the Lucene BM25), Copyright (c) 2024 Xing Han Lu,
  MIT License.
- PyStemmer 3.1.0 (Stemmer.Stemmer), Copyright (c) 2006 Richard Boulton, MIT
  License.
- pandas 3.1.0 (DataFrame, explode, pivot_table and the groupby mean),
  Copyright (c) 2008-2011 AQR Capital Management, LLC, Lambda Foundry, Inc. and
  PyData Development Team, and 2011-2026 Open source contributors, BSD
  3-Clause License.
- datasets 5.1.0 (load_dataset of JSON and parquet files, rename_column and
  from_dict of a Dataset), Copyright 2020 The HuggingFace Datasets Authors,
  Apache License 2.0.
- huggingface_hub 2.3.0 (list_repo_tree), Copyright 2020 The HuggingFace
  Team, Apache License 2.0.
- fsspec 2026.7.0 (glob_translate, which copies CPython's glob.translate),
  Copyright (c) 2018, Martin Durant, BSD 3-Clause License.

The npm dependency hyparquet (Hyperparam, MIT License) reads the parquet
files. The package does not include its code.

